        "body": "Bobby sends your question and market data to OpenAI or Anthropic, depending on the analysis level. With voice on, reply text goes to OpenAI or Microsoft for speech. Dictation is transcribed on your iPhone when the language is installed; otherwise Apple's speech service transcribes it. Bobby does not store the audio. Avoid personal or account details. You can withdraw AI consent here at any time."
